     23  8528 ????						; Kerberos MIDI, DATEL emulation (MC6850 ACIA at $DE04-$DE07).
     24  8528 ????						; Flash Fat Chip 64 with MIDI emulation = DATEL / Siel / JMS.
     25  8528 ????	       de 04	   ACIA_CTRL  equ	$DE04
     26  8528 ????	       de 05	   ACIA_TX    equ	$DE05
