    310  0a6d							;------------------------------------------------------------- interrupts
    311  0a6d							; Every 1/4 ms: take a MIDI-in byte, feed the ACIA one byte (fast path).
    312  0a6d							; Every fourth time (1 ms):
    313  0a6d							; count a tick and move paced messages onto the wire.
