    182  2fe1							; The vibrato, glide and detune the SID uses (FxTick, voices.asm). Each is
    183  2fe1							; the menu's choice: AS SOUND (the sound's), ON (the ADVANCED SOUND values),
    184  2fe1							; OFF. VIBRATO or GLIDE held turns on what's off (the ADVANCED SOUND values;
    185  2fe1							; a held VIBRATO has no delay); TAPE WOBBLE held: a deep slow vibrato, each
    186  2fe1							; voice its own phase; WIDE held: the detune about twice as wide.
