    476  46ad							; What SPACE and the keytar's buttons do (menu: SPACE, ... BUTTON):
    477  46ad							;   held     MUTE, BEND DOWN, BEND UP, VIBRATO, TREMOLO, ARP, STUTTER,
    478  46ad							;	      VINYL STOP, GLIDE, SUSTAIN, OCTAVE UP, REPEAT, FILTER SWEEP,
    479  46ad							;	      BEAT FILL, TAPE WOBBLE, WIDE
    480  46ad							;   a press  TAP TEMPO, BEAT ON/OFF, NEXT SOUND; or NOTHING
